# =============================================================================
# NexoraHub Customer Frontend (Frontend_Node/) — Configuration
#
# Copy to .env and adjust if needed. This app calls the backend's
# /api/v1/customer/* tree for customer endpoints and the bare /api root for
# public catalogue routes (categories, brands) — see src/lib/config.ts.
#
# Fixed local dev/start port: 3001 (see package.json "dev"/"start" scripts,
# which pass `-p 3001` explicitly so it never collides with the admin
# frontend on 3000). If you deploy behind a platform that injects its own
# PORT (Render, Railway, etc.), override the start script for that
# environment instead of relying on this file for the port.
# =============================================================================

# Backend API root (no trailing slash). Must match the backend's PORT
# (backend/.env, default 5000) and be included in the backend's CORS_ORIGIN.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
